    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Math Match Three  is a Match Three game with math elements, where players only need to connect numbers with the same factors into three to pass the level. Compared to traditional three elimination games, it is more challenging and rewarding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay description: Swap blocks in the grid and connect three numbers with the same factor to eliminate them. If there are already three connected, exchange any two. For example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12, 24, and 36 all contain a factor of 4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10, 50, and 100 all contain factors 5 and 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11, 22, and 33 all contain a factor of 11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 28 49 They all contain a factor of 7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >39 78 91 They all contain a factor of 13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting it into three or more can eliminate it. If three are already connected in the grid, swapping any two of them can trigger elimination. Eliminating blocks will earn points, and reaching the target score will clear the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Math Match Three  is a Match Three game with math elements, where players only need to connect numbers with the same factors into three to pass the level. Compared to traditional three elimination games, it is more challenging and rewarding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay description: Swap blocks in the grid and connect three numbers with the same factor to eliminate them. If there are already three connected, exchange any two. For example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12, 24, and 36 all contain a factor of 4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10, 50, and 100 all contain factors 5 and 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11, 22, and 33 all contain a factor of 11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 28 49 They all contain a factor of 7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >39 78 91 They all contain a factor of 13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting it into three or more can eliminate it. If three are already connected in the grid, swapping any two of them can trigger elimination. Eliminating blocks will earn points, and reaching the target score will clear the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Math Match Three is a Match Three game with math elements,Connect numbers with the same factors into three to pass the level.Continuously improve your mathematical skills during the clearance process!",
